# An accepted registration replaces the runtime descriptors instead of merging.
MODULE: CatalogAppendOnlyReplaces
TARGET: CatalogAppendOnly
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the registry persists only the latest registration's descriptors
PERTURBS: Register

--- FIND
    /\ rtD' = IF ok THEN rtD \cup (a.d \ HostD) ELSE rtD
--- REPLACE
    /\ rtD' = IF ok THEN a.d \ HostD ELSE rtD
--- END